AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:30042117") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_4023130> "A neuron that expresses kisspeptin. These neurons are predominantly located in the hypothalamus, but also found in other parts of the brain including the hippocampal dentate gyrus.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/terms_contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_4023130> <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7258-9596>)
